# Inbound email webhook (Postmark). Postmark does not sign its webhooks, so the
# endpoint is protected by HTTP Basic auth embedded in the webhook URL:
#   https://<user>:<password>@your-host/api/inbound/postmark
# Use HTTPS only: Basic auth is cleartext otherwise. Leave these empty and the
# endpoint refuses every request with 503 rather than running unauthenticated.
INBOUND_WEBHOOK_USER=""
INBOUND_WEBHOOK_PASSWORD=""
